WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.167
-Performing "Headstone"

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:04.200
from their Grammy-nominated
album "Skeletons,"

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.868
please welcome Brothers Osborne!

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:10.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.968 --> 00:00:16.567
♪♪

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:22.133
♪♪

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:23.067
-Hey!

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:28.234
♪♪

00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:33.400
♪♪

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.000
-♪ My skin ain't thin,
but when I come unhinged ♪

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.667
♪ I'm a little
bit more than crazy ♪

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:41.100
♪ Work like a dog,
but the way I talk ♪

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.000
♪ Is a little laid back
and lazy ♪

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.267
♪ I'm not a man of many words ♪

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:49.200
♪ But my words
are as good as gold ♪

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.834
♪ And you can bet your ass
I'll have your back ♪

00:00:51.834 --> 00:00:54.701
♪ When the rubber
meets the road ♪

00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:56.100
♪♪

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.601
-♪ Write that on my headstone ♪

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:01.467
♪♪

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:04.334
♪ Write that on my headstone ♪

00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:08.167
♪♪

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:10.767
♪ Off the rails, off the walls ♪

00:01:10.767 --> 00:01:13.400
♪ Never was the one
to back down ♪

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.000
♪ Gave it hell
and I had a ball ♪

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.701
♪ Like tomorrow
was never coming back 'round ♪

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:21.033
-♪ Live to love
and love to live ♪

00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:23.968
♪ Like the lights
are never coming back on ♪

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:26.133
♪ Day and night, night and day ♪

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:30.133
♪ I did it my way,
right or wrong ♪

00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:33.400
♪ It's a wonder
that I made it this long ♪

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:36.033
-♪ Write that on my headstone ♪

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:38.734
♪♪

00:01:38.734 --> 00:01:41.634
♪ Write that on my headstone ♪

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.334
♪♪

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:46.334
♪ Yeah, when I'm dead and gone ♪

00:01:46.334 --> 00:01:49.400
♪♪

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.634
♪ Write that on my headstone ♪

00:01:52.634 --> 00:01:53.567
-♪ Yes ♪

00:01:53.567 --> 00:02:02.767
♪♪

00:02:02.767 --> 00:02:11.934
♪♪

00:02:11.934 --> 00:02:21.067
♪♪

00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:30.200
♪♪

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:39.367
♪♪

00:02:39.367 --> 00:02:48.501
♪♪

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:57.634
♪♪

00:02:57.634 --> 00:03:06.868
♪♪

00:03:06.868 --> 00:03:16.000
♪♪

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.100
♪ Here lies a man
who gave a damn ♪

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:20.367
♪ Wasn't scared
to stand for something ♪

00:03:20.367 --> 00:03:23.000
♪ Lived it hard and fast
in that dash ♪

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.200
♪ Carved between those numbers ♪

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.467
♪ And if you're reading this
you can reminisce ♪

00:03:27.467 --> 00:03:29.467
♪ But don't cry for me,
brother ♪

00:03:29.467 --> 00:03:31.767
♪ Pour enough whiskey
on this grave ♪

00:03:31.767 --> 00:03:36.634
