down six feet under ♪

00:03:38.868 --> 00:03:41.968
-♪ Write that on my headstone ♪

00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:44.734
♪♪

00:03:44.734 --> 00:03:47.567
♪ Write that on my headstone ♪

00:03:47.567 --> 00:03:49.434
♪♪

00:03:49.434 --> 00:03:52.834
♪ Yeah, when I'm dead and gone ♪

00:03:52.834 --> 00:03:55.567
♪♪

00:03:55.567 --> 00:03:58.767
♪ Write that on my headstone ♪

00:03:58.767 --> 00:04:00.100
♪ Headstone ♪

00:04:00.167 --> 00:04:01.234
♪ Headstone ♪

